    "innovation": "Using idealized aqua-planet model simulations, this paper demonstrates that enhanced subtropical ocean warming, driven by background Ekman convergence of anomalous heat, is the dominant mechanism driving the poleward shift of climate zones, rather than the direct radiative forcing of CO2.",
